    "Id": "chassisdef_grand_crusader_GRN-D-02-B",
    "Name": "Grand Crusader",
    "Details": "One of two subvariants of the -02 line of the Grand Crusader based on the -01-X prototype. The -02-B retained the larger engine of the prototype, but like the other production models based of it dropped the shoulder turrets. The design switched to two ER Large Lasers and two Medium Pulse Lasers as the energy weapons, while keeping the -01's Anti Missile System.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
